# dotnet run -> http://localhost:5122 | docker compose -> http://localhost:6006
@host = http://localhost:5122

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Readiness (confirma a conexão com o RabbitMQ)
GET {{host}}/api/health/ready

### Enviar email
# @name createMessage
POST {{host}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: welcome-user-42

{
  "system": "demo-app",
  "subjectCode": "welcome-email",
  "notificationType": "Email",
  "recipients": ["user@example.com"],
  "metadata": {
    "subject": "Bem-vindo!",
    "template": "<h1>Olá, {{name}}!</h1><p>Sua conta foi criada com sucesso.</p>",
    "name": "Maria"
  }
}

### Enviar SMS
POST {{host}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system": "demo-app",
  "subjectCode": "order-sms",
  "notificationType": "Sms",
  "recipients": ["+5511999999999"],
  "metadata": { "message": "Seu pedido foi enviado!" }
}

### Enviar WhatsApp
POST {{host}}/api/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "system": "demo-app",
  "subjectCode": "promo-whatsapp",
  "notificationType": "WhatsApp",
  "recipients": ["+5511988888888"],
  "metadata": { "message": "Confira as novidades!" }
}

### Status de uma mensagem
GET {{host}}/api/message/{{createMessage.response.body.correlationId}}

### Auditoria (filtros: status, system, notificationType, from, to, page, pageSize)
GET {{host}}/api/messages?status=SENT&page=1&pageSize=20
